      "seed": 1406241554,
      "version": 1848,
      "versionNonce": 2019338477,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773169837243,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "target is r;\n\nwithin window u would try to make [ l, r-1 ] ele's into r through performing operations\nwherein those operations being ( + || - ) -> [-k, k]\n\nint count = 0;\n\nint matched = 0, no_of_operations_left = k;\n\nat first l = 0; r= 1\n\nfor(r; r < nums.size(); r++)\n\n  int difference = r-l   // 4-1 = 3 \n\nwhile(difference >= -k && difference <= k){\n        nums[l] += difference;\n        no_of_operations_left -= 1; \n        temp++;\n           count  = max(count, temp);\n}\n\n}",
      "fontSize": 29,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "target is r;\n\nwithin window u would try to make [ l, r-1 ] ele's into r through performing operations\nwherein those operations being ( + || - ) -> [-k, k]\n\nint count = 0;\n\nint matched = 0, no_of_operations_left = k;\n\nat first l = 0; r= 1\n\nfor(r; r < nums.size(); r++)\n\n  int difference = r-l   // 4-1 = 3 \n\nwhile(difference >= -k && difference <= k){\n        nums[l] += difference;\n        no_of_operations_left -= 1; \n        temp++;\n           count  = max(count, temp);\n}\n\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
