      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773169837243,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "sliding_window -- within window u would try to make [ l, r-1 ] ele's into r through performing operations\nwherein those operations being ( + || - ) -> [-k, k]\n\ncore things to maintain:\n{ l, r\n  no_of_operations_left, \n  matched_ele,\n      max_freq\n    range\n}\n\nsort\nonly perform the operation if the difference exists in [-k, k];\ncontrol no_of_operations_left through dependancy change on max_freq;\ni.e if max_freq, unchanged after operation then no_of_operations shall be -1 or else +1;\n",
      "fontSize": 29,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "sliding_window -- within window u would try to make [ l, r-1 ] ele's into r through performing operations\nwherein those operations being ( + || - ) -> [-k, k]\n\ncore things to maintain:\n{ l, r\n  no_of_operations_left, \n  matched_ele,\n      max_freq\n    range\n}\n\nsort\nonly perform the operation if the difference exists in [-k, k];\ncontrol no_of_operations_left through dependancy change on max_freq;\ni.e if max_freq, unchanged after operation then no_of_operations shall be -1 or else +1;\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
