      "text": "get window with targetSum = (totalSum - k)\nl,r at 0\nincrement and find a window which reaches \nthe target, increment r till targetSum decrement\nl if = targetSum exceeded.\n\ncapture the max_window with the targetSum\n\n\nreturn  nums.size() - max_window to get the \nwindow size of the remaining window whose\nsum == k",
      "fontSize": 29,
