    {
      "id": "xljp6ilYiDJyr5wAkM-Ex",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9256.425940251658,
      "y": 14400.918040082857,
      "width": 875.2896118164062,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1035201701,
      "version": 1243,
      "versionNonce": 1470246861,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773169837245,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "intuition:\ncalc every possible window and check for elasticity,\n\nwhile checking we get three cases:\n1. either it's gonna be an exact match to K -- max_elastic_window = max();\n2. or greater than K -- check if (formula - K) is present in (r-l +1)\n3. less than K -- just proceed, no deletion\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "intuition:\ncalc every possible window and check for elasticity,\n\nwhile checking we get three cases:\n1. either it's gonna be an exact match to K -- max_elastic_window = max();\n2. or greater than K -- check if (formula - K) is present in (r-l +1)\n3. less than K -- just proceed, no deletion\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FL_IIZ-XBq3L7AmPfdHun",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9247.286209648648,
      "y": 14804.390213297667,
      "width": 1184.221435546875,
      "height": 682.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 875086213,
      "version": 1466,
      "versionNonce": 1489284653,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773169837245,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "int k = 4;\nint l = 0, r = 0;\nint current_window_size = 0;\nint max_elastic_window = INT_MIN;\n\nfor(r; r < arr.size(); r++){\ncurrent_window_size = r+l-1;\nint formula = max(arr.substr(l, r)) - min(arr.substr(l,r));\n\nif(formula == K){\nmax_elastic_window = max(max_elastic_window, r-l +1)\n}\n\nif(formula > K){\nint diff = formula - K;\n(arr.substr(l,r).find(diff) == true) ? max_elastic_window = max(max_elastic_window, r-l +1) : continue;\n}\n\nwhile(flag == true)\nbool flag == true;\nif()",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int k = 4;\nint l = 0, r = 0;\nint current_window_size = 0;\nint max_elastic_window = INT_MIN;\n\nfor(r; r < arr.size(); r++){\ncurrent_window_size = r+l-1;\nint formula = max(arr.substr(l, r)) - min(arr.substr(l,r));\n\nif(formula == K){\nmax_elastic_window = max(max_elastic_window, r-l +1)\n}\n\nif(formula > K){\nint diff = formula - K;\n(arr.substr(l,r).find(diff) == true) ? max_elastic_window = max(max_elastic_window, r-l +1) : continue;\n}\n\nwhile(flag == true)\nbool flag == true;\nif()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
