      "originalText": "intuition:\nsort by deadline\nthen make sure to find the least possible deadline that\nwe could satisfy through our total_consumed_time.\nbut then we could encounter an edge case where in\nif we find more than one jobs which satisfies the above\ncondition then check the profits col's and only select the one \nwith the maximum profit",
