      "text": "apply traversal on the src node i.e\ngrid[2][2] : then\nfirst capture the color code of the src node\nthen traverse from -1 - +1 skip (i || j == abs(1))\n->\nif the fellow nodes also have the same color then change the color i.e grid[src] = color",
