      "updated": 1773169837246,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "maintain visited vector,\napart from that first traverse from start to the end of the matrix \nif grid[i][j] == 1, apply dfs and traverse across all it's neighbours with a counter = 0;\nincrement the counter on every traversal with 4d checking of bounderies i.e if( node+1 is out of bounds)\n when the traversal ends in the sense that there arent any neighbours left\nthen if the condition is passed reset counter or else keep it,, while doing all of this maintain visited",
      "fontSize": 35,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "maintain visited vector,\napart from that first traverse from start to the end of the matrix \nif grid[i][j] == 1, apply dfs and traverse across all it's neighbours with a counter = 0;\nincrement the counter on every traversal with 4d checking of bounderies i.e if( node+1 is out of bounds)\n when the traversal ends in the sense that there arent any neighbours left\nthen if the condition is passed reset counter or else keep it,, while doing all of this maintain visited",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
