      "updated": 1780319805065,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "0 1 2 4 5 7\n\nans: 0-2. 4-5, 7\n\nint temp = arr[0]\n\nif(next == temp+1) -> temp = next;\n\nelse ans.push_back(temp) and temp = next;\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
